# Night Circuit — genre preset memory

**User product memory (2026-09-24):** Factory and featured curation should cover these **synthetic** trap-adjacent styles (not acoustic emulations):

| Tag | Role in bank | Foundation anchors (category · name) |
|-----|----------------|--------------------------------------|
| **wavephonk** | Memphis / phonk weight + lead | Bass · Wavephonk Knock · Lead · Wavephonk Bell |
| **wave** | Dreamy poly beds | Synth · Wave Horizon |
| **vapor trap** | Vapor + trap hybrid | Synth · Vapor Trap Glass · Pluck/Keys · Vapor Trap Click |
| **chillwave** | Slow tape haze | Pad · Chillwave Drift |
| **hardware** | Stack / Juno-mode poly | Synth · Hardware Juno Stack |
| **ambient phonk** | Dark drifting atmosphere | Pad · Ambient Phonk Void |
| **cloud phonk** | Soft detuned sub cloud | Bass · Cloud Phonk Mist |

When adding presets: keep **1,028** factory count; edit `FoundationPresets.cpp` + adjust `kFoundationPresetCount` / `kVariationPresetCount`; register featured names in `FeaturedPresets.cpp`. Details: `ProphetRev2Trap/design/AGENT_MEMORY_GENRES.md`.
